# Simulation output is COMMITTED on purpose. It is deterministic (same seed, same
# fixture, same bytes -- there is a test for that), so committing it lets a reviewer
# and the web app see the results without running anything, while `pnpm sim`
# regenerates it for anyone who wants to check.

